#: ../../source/users/conductor/type/multiline_conductor.rst:7
msgid "Multiline conductor"
msgstr "多线导体"

#: ../../source/users/conductor/type/multiline_conductor.rst:9
msgid ""
"Multiline conductors are used at `multiline diagrams`_. Multiline conductors"
" are used for the representation of each terminal, line and phase from two "
"and three phase power systems. Multiline conductors are used for the "
"individual representation of all electric and control systems."
msgstr ""
"多线导体用于 `多线图 <multiline diagrams_>`_ "
"。多线导体用于表示两相和三相电力系统中的每个端子、线路和相位。多线导体用于单独表示所有电气和控制系统。"

#: ../../source/users/conductor/type/multiline_conductor.rst:16
msgid ""
"At fluid power schemas, a multiline conductor represents each pressure, "
"return and control line."
msgstr "在流体动力原理图中，多线导体表示每条压力线、回油线和控制线。"

#: ../../source/users/conductor/type/multiline_conductor.rst:19
msgid ""
"The main difference of multiline with respect to `single line conductors`_ "
"is the possibility to display text which is linked to the `conductor "
"properties`_."
msgstr ""
"多线导体相对于 `单线导体 <single line conductors_>`_ 的主要区别在于，它可以显示与 `导体属性 <conductor "
"properties_>`_ 关联的文本。"

#: ../../source/users/conductor/type/multiline_conductor.rst:25
msgid "Figure: Multiline conductor"
msgstr "图：多线导体"

#: ../../source/users/conductor/type/multiline_conductor.rst:27
msgid "The main features of multiline conductors are:"
msgstr "多线导体的主要特点如下："

#: ../../source/users/conductor/type/multiline_conductor.rst:29
msgid "Possibility to define properties (Function and voltage/protocol)"
msgstr "可以定义属性（功能和电压/协议）"

#: ../../source/users/conductor/type/multiline_conductor.rst:30
msgid ""
"Text linked to the conductor which can be displayed and its position is "
"relative to the conductor position."
msgstr "与导体关联的文本可以显示，其位置相对于导体的位置。"

#: ../../source/users/conductor/type/multiline_conductor.rst:31
msgid ""
"Possibility of displaying variables values at the conductor text (Auto "
"numbering, function or voltage/protocol)."
msgstr "可以在导体文本中显示变量值（自动编号、功能或电压/协议）。"

#: ../../source/users/conductor/type/multiline_conductor.rst:32
msgid ""
"Possibility of using the conductor variables at `element dynamic text`_ "
"(Function and voltage/protocol)."
msgstr "可以在 `元件动态文本 <element dynamic text_>`_ 中使用导体变量（功能和电压/协议）。"
